FUNCTION HTTPGET(URL)
* mvx-lang/curl — HTTP GET via curl, returning the response body.  UniData's
* native HTTPS (createSecureRequest) does not reliably reach github or follow
* redirects, so the curl package provides the HTTP seam the udt package manager
* relies on.  curl is a stated prerequisite (mvpkg's install.sh preflights it).
* GPL-2.0-only.
   TMP = "/tmp/mvpkg_get.tmp"
   EXECUTE '!curl -sL "' : URL : '" > ' : TMP
   BODY = ""
   OSREAD BODY FROM TMP ELSE BODY = ""
   EXECUTE '!rm -f ' : TMP
   RETURN BODY
